{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"30b78a1431c4c29aae457840150fb0738abe109776ae8b801a644c32aa7cac11","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"42e065c45ee6c93e608a033a449a9cdd261eddec92d939aa164c62e12628095c","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"431cacf5c731a9abf65ebc985c7ff5df804838312e9fa9ea8f9f5c1e75d923bf","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"tome-orcs/data/lore/emporium.lua:77-92（来源未固定）：1) 源文第77→78行标题与斜体行之间只有一个换行，译文为 \\n\\n，多出一个空行（换行不变量）；2) 'up to four years in prison, per tank' 被译成「并处四年监禁」，丢了 up to（最高），把封顶刑期写成了固定刑期；3) 'by over 40%' 被译成「减少40%」，丢了 over（超过）；4) 'declogging tonics may help' 被补译成「有助于提高产量」，源文并没有说帮助的是产量。"},{"revision_key":"433071ee0f8277a59e668b17e36ac0746b841b8b75fb3000ded290f1c369bb23","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"433d8e43247a8ee1afc2833ad89dd060a1336b3704c231b52b242f303583ada3","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"43415f0149310721d6a7c5fc262885936445c6122e034603e3eb089242d0921f","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"4344ce399ede894a7aa3a6af84c93b0c347a43200169811b6c46738327897bca","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"43cbe69c78e4370a12af9d4a391f8c488d928c693d209661cb0e18a8bf3c703e","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"43d64e16d118a6f700d7a08be2d864a5de274a9402354f4098e3b3a0f2678713","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"tome-orcs/data/chats/destructicus.lua:74-82（来源未固定）：1) 源文说玩家一边从窗户看导弹飞离，一边在 scrying panel（观测面板）上看到导弹朝镜头飞来、看到惊恐的乘客。译文删掉了面板，把两个视角合成一个窗外视角（「飞向你视线远处，拥挤的飞船里惊恐的乘客那边」），还补了源文没有的「拥挤」。这样后文「面板随之变暗」就失去了前提。2) 译文在「信号：」后和「的感受。」后各插入一个换行，源文这两段内部没有换行（换行不变量）。3) 'all the Orcs of Var'Eyal' 被译成「大陆上所有兽人」，丢了地名 Var'Eyal。"},{"revision_key":"43d8bb19bcd17f7f5fc086fc1296fbda5c733d51a1b5ebf29c680e2daf5fc587","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"tome-orcs/data/talents/steam/automation.lua:111（来源未固定）：源文是 'If they are stopped by a creature (or the target) both them and the creature take %0.2f physical damage'，被目标本身挡住也会触发伤害。译文「被其他生物阻挡」丢了 (or the target)，「其他」反而把目标排除在外，描述的机制与源文不符。另外首句的 'flying grapple' 被直接译成「无人机」，丢了飞爪这层意思。"},{"revision_key":"44947e3a4ca9b6178d09c47d95e63ea330bd35ba8a541d40a459dcfde035e509","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"4511302c8fa2fe4ab0ddf7d1931759e60f23abd028e21a790214fbaaa6e7d219","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"461ab2185c452cff1f1d499a7e6dc0a89c780ce972b7c8aebac4d14beea523ef","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"46816fdd4863e116c104b5d18ef4f53d289a1708207eba8715916391c4f87796","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"46b5e759b98d2f3cd2605817d62e9eeea5b7be1a677ad85c8d7a015c02b86e53","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"tome-orcs/data/talents/steam/other.lua:910-911（来源未固定）：1) 源文 'healing other mechanical creatures' 限定只治疗施法者以外的机械生物，译文「修复机械生物」丢了 other，读起来像施法者自己也会被治疗；2) 'a cone of healing' 被译成「锥形……的修理器」，把一道锥形治疗效果写成了一件器物，与源文不符。"},{"revision_key":"4712cc5e45f00f5e855b5b8106cfa6d7f336003187e35c0f740e5c412f021a37","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"tome-orcs/data/quests/kruk-invasion.lua:78（来源未固定）：源文 'Kruk Pride is safe for now' 带有 for now（暂时），译文「克鲁克部落安全了」丢了这个限定，把暂时安全说成了已经安全，与后面「现在是复仇的时刻」这段剧情的走向不符。"}]}